            <ArticleTitle>Anidoxime: a clinical trial of an oral analgesic agent.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>257-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The new oral analgesic drug anidoxime was compared with dihydrocodeine. There were no side-effects, and no significant differences between the effects of dihydrocodeine 50 mg, anidoxime 75 mg or anidoxime 100 mg.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
